      "id": "r20261102-a01",
      "title": "Bima's Paper Plane Contest",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Bima's school held a paper plane contest on Friday. Every student brought one paper plane made at home.",
        "Bima practiced all week. He folded his plane carefully and drew a red star on each wing. His dad taught him to make the wings flat and wide so the plane could fly far.",
        "At the contest, Bima threw his plane. It flew over the fence and landed on the roof of the library! Bima won second place. He was very happy and gave his dad a big hug."
      ],
